# SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Pôle d'Expertise de la Régulation Numérique <contact@peren.gouv.fr>
# SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-4.0
#
# Format: one "<sha256>  <relative/path>" line per file (sha256sum convention, two spaces).
# Paths are relative to the repository root. Verified by scripts/fetch_data.py --check-only
# (04 B2). Entries whose hash is 64 zeros are OFF-DISK / externally-hosted and are SKIPPED
# as external by the verifier (never PASS/FAIL).
#
# Regenerate after (re)building a member archive:
#     python scripts/gen_manifest.py <member-dir> --prefix Productions/<member> --out - 
#   then paste the lines here and commit (see data/README.md).
#
# HETEROGENEOUS SOURCES (name — role — size):
#   Productions/FLiPS_ICML_light_subset/  — in-repo zero-download CPU smoke subset (committed; backs `make smoke`/`gate-golden`) — ~92 MB
#   Productions/LLMmap_ICML_run/          — 205-class LLMmap traces (backs LLMmap E3) — ~5.3 GB, 600 files
#                                           (an accidental partial-duplicate `…_5_4 copy/` dir was pruned before upload)
#   Productions/Intersection_vocab/       — tokenizer-vocabulary intersection (TRACKED IN-REPO, not archived) — 180 KB
#   Productions/FLiPS_ICML_run/           — headline run (96%/90% E1/E2 + FLIPS E3 arms); HPC export ingested locally,
#                                           sanitized (no /lustre paths) and hashed below — 81 files (25 base + 8 quant
#                                           + 7 abliterated). Zenodo-hosted; fetch_data.py reproduces these paths on download.
#
# NOTE: hashes for LLMmap_ICML_run and FLiPS_ICML_run pin the build-machine canonical source tree (provenance). The published Zenodo
# archive layout is reproduced by fetch_data.py at these same paths; if a maintainer prunes a member before upload,
# regenerate its block with gen_manifest.py and recommit.
